  "description": "Contentstack agent skills for Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and Gemini.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **21 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (21): `brand-kit-assistant`, `cms-assets`, `cms-branches-aliases`, `cms-data-modeling-best-practices`, `cms-entries`, `cms-environments-publishing`, `cms-live-preview-visual-builder-support-assistant`, `cms-localization`, and 13 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install contentstack-skills@claude-community` from `contentstack/contentstack-agent-skills`.\n\nA bundle of 21 ready-to-use Contentstack agent skills for AI coding tools, covering CMS implementation, Brand Kit guidance, delivery SDK development, migration workflows, Developer Hub app architecture, and Launch automation.",
